Add SlotOptimizer.step_many: step several LoRA slots with one gradient-norm all-reduce

Applies to modal-projects/miles at fdd808c008175d4895fd8c57c95ef4fa5bb6a2a0 (spindle-miles)
and f2f8447c33ac0755a0988c30d413d334dea0a26a (spindle-miles-v0.1.2); the touched files are
identical on both. Apply with `git apply patches/miles-step-many.patch` from the Miles root.

Spindle's optimizer overlap calls `SlotOptimizer.step_many(requests)` when every slot
optimizer in a group shares a class that defines it; the per-slot math is the sequential
`clip_and_step` math and only the norm reduction is shared.
